ess_config.py` certifies the hook rail is\n      # ALIVE, not merely present (the S254 dead-pair-rail class: a\n      # registered hook whose shim path never resolves fail-opens `{}`\n      # silently at runtime and no static exec-bit sweep sees it):\n      #   - static: runtime-resolution model over settings.json hook\n      #     commands ($CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR-anchored or absolute only; shim\n      #     args must resolve at the shim's dirname), inline-secret scan,\n      #     DENY_BASELINE subset check, no-op annotation check, plus\n      #     delegation to check-active-hooks-executable.py (exec bits —\n      #     single owner, re-run here so this gate is self-contained).\n      #   - behavioral: replays planted-violation fixtures\n      #     (.claude/hooks/_lib/harness_replay/ — inert\n      #     test data) through the REAL hooks in a hermetic env (temp\n      #     HOME/GNUPGHOME, no override/sentinel env leakage) and asserts\n      #     each rail BLOCKS its positive control. A dead rail cannot\n      #     pass this half.\n      # No-arg invocation = static + replay, matching the /ceo-boot\n      # `harness_config_gate` check for CI/boot parity. Local-only: NO\n      # network, NO credential — safe on fork PRs. CEO_SOTA_DISABLE=1\n      # skips the replay half in-script (static unaffected); the\n      # job-level `if:` gate above skips the whole job anyway.\n      # Exit contract: 0 green / 1 RED finding(s) / 2 unusable input —\n      # ANY non-zero fails this step (fail-closed gate context).\n      #\n      # Collection note (PLAN-153 Wave E): the Wave E pytest files\n      # (test_check_harness_config.py, test_bash_citation_gate.py,\n      # test_prompt_defense_baseline.py,\n      # test_postcompact_reinject_no_exec_payload.py -> .claude/hooks/tests/;\n      # test_ceo_boot_liveness.py, test_check_action_sha_drift.py [ext],\n      # test_check_agents_md.py -> .claude/scripts/tests/) are collected\n      # by the EXISTING directory pins of the hook-tests-python-matrix job\n      # (PLAN-186 W4a) — deliberately NOT re-listed as explicit paths\n      # (debate C1 in the\n      # PLAN-152 tests-01 comment: explicit re-listing of files under an\n      # already-pinned directory double-collects them).\n      # -----------------------------------------------------------------\n      - name: Harness-config gate (PLAN-153 E1 — static + positive-control replay)\n        run: |\n          set -euo pipefail\n          cd \"$GITHUB_WORKSPACE\"\n          python3 .claude/hooks/check_harness_config.py\n\n      # -----------------------------------------------------------------\n      # Step: npm bundle sync gate (Session 75 Finding 3 + Owner D1)\n      # -----------------------------------------------------------------\n      # The npm/.claude, npm/SPEC, npm/scripts, npm/templates, npm/VERSION","numLines":50,"startLine":1108,"totalLines":1787}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_015Q2WPkEWcFVRiWaHVHr2Fi","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
